{"title":"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Induction,_Generalization)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Induction, Generalization)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The product of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> factors <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/6/be6d10c560c43ec6053c4f283696bd15ae9a2831.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Big(1 - \\frac12\\Big)\\Big(1 - \\frac13\\Big)\\Big(1 - \\frac14\\Big)\\cdots\\Big(1 - \\frac {1}{10}\\Big) =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"317\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c17a4c7fad92f5b93ebf5e5718ba48a73d22ecd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\frac {1}{10} \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ \\frac {1}{9} \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ \\frac {1}{2} \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ \\frac {10}{11} \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ \\frac {11}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"376\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Simplifying each factor and cancelling yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/918dab3b99571637b3104eb0cc7ec9b40b08f18c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Big(1 - \\frac12\\Big)\\Big(1 - \\frac13\\Big)\\Big(1 - \\frac14\\Big)\\cdots\\Big(1 - \\frac {1}{10}\\Big) =\\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{2}{3}\\right)\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)\\cdots\\left(\\frac{9}{10}\\right) = \\frac{1\\cdot2\\cdot3\\cdot4\\cdot5\\cdot6\\cdot7\\cdot8\\cdot9}{2\\cdot3\\cdot4\\cdot5\\cdot6\\cdot7\\cdot8\\cdot9\\cdot10} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"841\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Induction.2C_Generalization.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Induction,_Generalization)\">Solution 2 (Induction, Generalization)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Induction, Generalization)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It can be proven by induction that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/0/50050e051d95604e7dea092b8d7089e3226c7fcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\cdots\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{n}\\right) = \\frac{1}{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"211\" height=\"45\" /> for all integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/2/72287b09043ed45b372a517d764e12d07aff8071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>For the base case, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/8/598a16d4b7dde3dec3a390109882d54bb0308ea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 2$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, then this product is simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/f/bff3a3b0be103073aad3b2d2cb7b6ccbb52b2b44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - \\frac{1}{2} = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"80\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p>For the inductive case, assume that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4ac3205a424aa24f791878eb7f3833c0a97b4d3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\cdots\\left(1-\\frac{1}{k}\\right) = \\frac{1}{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"209\" height=\"45\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/5/035b829f48c1e3f392d48de80f482200fd4bc020.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(1 - \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\cdots\\left(1-\\frac{1}{k+1}\\right) = \\left(1 - \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\cdots\\left(1-\\frac{1}{k}\\right)\\left(1-\\frac{1}{k+1}\\right) = \\left(\\frac{1}{k}\\right)\\left(\\frac{k}{k+1}\\right) = \\frac{k}{k(k+1)} = \\frac{1}{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"804\" height=\"45\" />.  This completes the induction.\n</p><p>Applying this lemma for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/1/fa17013a449147f7545eaf8c6efd44b5b9fa2034.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"13\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/2/882b883c11d78bf2dfc91480ef91c221662894a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"70\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZUZk6J2wCw8\">https://youtu.be/ZUZk6J2wCw8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME\" title=\"1985 AJHSME\">1985 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" ali